  "description": "Late at night, a moaning sound is heard in the office of GPSP (Gaepalja Sangpalja), a social media for dogs. Seo-Jun, the owner of the strange voice, consoles himself with the clothes of Tae-San, the person he has a crush on, sitting next to him, and spits out words that sound like lamentations about his life. \"I wish I had been born a dog.\" And the next morning, Seo-Jun has become a dog.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
